            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The labels are short and reasonable. Phormula-1 Chocolate Milkshake lists whey isolate, cocoa, sunflower lecithin, natural flavor, salt and sucralose, with 0 g of sugar. Level-1 adds milk protein and has 2 g of sugar. 1st Phorm says it removed artificial dyes and flavors. The standard flavors still use sucralose; the Natural versions use monk fruit or stevia instead."
